          "sha256": "7d016703fd050276cbb240f3468378c3613eac4eaa4daebf3f2d74d76a50cc50",
          "headings": [
            "Explore / Research Runtime Index v0",
            "I. 先收敛本体：五个概念已经足够",
            "II. DSH 最值得作为 Core 的结构参考",
            "III. Pi 最值得消费的是 Session 与消息投递语义",
            "`steer`",
            "`followUp`",
            "IV. OpenCode 最值得取的是产品语义，而不是 runtime 内核",
            "V. Codex 给出了非常好的“最小 multi-agent control plane”",
            "VI. Deep Research 应该被理解成一种 Run，而不是一种 Chat",
            "VII. 最小 Harness Contract",
            "VIII. Explore 应当成为第一个 first-party RunKind",
            "IX. 不要让 Explore 每次重新读整个 workspace",
            "X. UI：不建议把 Subagent Tree 放在主界面",
            "Level 1 — 一张 Run Card",
            "Level 2 — Activity Rail",
            "Level 3 — Worker Cluster",
            "Level 4 — Worker Inspector",
            "XI. 一个更有 SE 辨识度的 UI：Promotion Tray",
            "XII. Deep Research UI 还可以多一个 Plan Sheet",
            "XIII. `steer` 也可以做成人类熟悉的 UI，而不是聊天 hack",
            "XIV. Agent Teams 暂不进入 Core",
            "XV. 推荐选型归纳",
            "XVI. Core / Capability / Adapter 边界",
            "建议作为后续施工索引的第一批主源"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
